{
  "description": "A Collie Client's hello accepted, then a Run started, with no check of its Session's source at either (ADR 0115); then its first four pages refused while the default Session opens from a `cdp_url`, one per remedy: nothing answering at http://127.0.0.1:9222 (`cdp_url_unreachable`, retryable, `failure: connection_refused`), a page target's WebSocket where a browser's was expected (`cdp_url_not_browser`, naming what answered and the browser address the host's /json/version lists), a 401 from the browser's service (`cdp_url_unauthorized`, naming the header sent and its Secret reference, never its value) and a loopback address from the project configuration of a Client acting for a model (`cdp_url_not_allowed`, naming the rule and the settings layer); the Run then finishes. The `cdp-url-errors` client conformance case.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "expect": {
        "method": "hello",
        "params": {
          "protocol_version": "0.1",
          "surface": "sdk_typescript",
          "form": "typescript",
          "needs": "collie",
          "product_version": "0.0.0",
          "log_level": "off"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "reply": {
        "result": {
          "protocol_version": "0.1",
          "product": "collie",
          "product_version": "0.0.0",
          "engine_instance": "0123456789abcdef"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "expect": {
        "method": "run.start",
        "params": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "reply": {
        "result": {
          "run_id": "01ke6p4ym0j8x3v5wq2rtbn7hc",
          "lifecycle": "running",
          "needs": "collie",
          "started_as": "new"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "expect": {
        "method": "run.new_page",
        "params": {
          "run_id": "01ke6p4ym0j8x3v5wq2rtbn7hc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": -32006,
          "message": "nothing answered at the `cdp_url` http://127.0.0.1:9222, which the user configuration sets: the connection was refused",
          "data": {
            "code": "cdp_url_unreachable",
            "retryable": true,
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:9222",
            "layer": "user_configuration",
            "failure": "connection_refused",
            "fix": "Start the browser with remote debugging on that port, or correct the address"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "expect": {
        "method": "run.new_page",
        "params": {
          "run_id": "01ke6p4ym0j8x3v5wq2rtbn7hc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": -32001,
          "message": "the `cdp_url` ws://127.0.0.1:9222/devtools/page/8C5F0D1E, which the user configuration sets, is a page target's, not a browser's",
          "data": {
            "code": "cdp_url_not_browser",
            "retryable": false,
            "url": "ws://127.0.0.1:9222/devtools/page/8C5F0D1E",
            "layer": "user_configuration",
            "observed": "a CDP target of type `page`",
            "browser_url": "ws://127.0.0.1:9222/devtools/browser/1A2B3C4D",
            "fix": "Give the browser's endpoint, ws://127.0.0.1:9222/devtools/browser/1A2B3C4D, which this host's /json/version lists"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "expect": {
        "method": "run.new_page",
        "params": {
          "run_id": "01ke6p4ym0j8x3v5wq2rtbn7hc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": -32002,
          "message": "the `cdp_url` https://browser.example.com/, which the user configuration sets, answered 401 to the credentials sent",
          "data": {
            "code": "cdp_url_unauthorized",
            "retryable": false,
            "url": "https://browser.example.com/",
            "layer": "user_configuration",
            "status": 401,
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": "env:BROWSER_TOKEN"
            },
            "fix": "Check the Secret references in `headers`"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "expect": {
        "method": "run.new_page",
        "params": {
          "run_id": "01ke6p4ym0j8x3v5wq2rtbn7hc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": -32002,
          "message": "the `cdp_url` http://127.0.0.1:9222, which the project configuration sets, is a loopback address, which a Client acting for a model may not use",
          "data": {
            "code": "cdp_url_not_allowed",
            "retryable": false,
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:9222",
            "layer": "project_configuration",
            "rule": "loopback",
            "address": "127.0.0.1",
            "fix": "Set the address in Operator policy or in user configuration, or give a public address"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "expect": {
        "method": "run.finish",
        "params": {
          "run_id": "01ke6p4ym0j8x3v5wq2rtbn7hc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "reply": {
        "result": {
          "run_id": "01ke6p4ym0j8x3v5wq2rtbn7hc",
          "lifecycle": "finished",
          "verdict": "verified",
          "completeness": "complete",
          "started_at": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
          "ended_at": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
          "usage": {
            "model": {
              "calls": 0,
              "tokens": 0,
              "input_tokens": 0,
              "cache_read_tokens": 0,
              "cache_write_tokens": 0,
              "output_tokens": 0,
              "reasoning_tokens": 0,
              "price": null
            },
            "browser_time": 0,
            "proxy_bytes": 0,
            "requests": 0
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
